191
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Sibe we bi xêr.
 
Good morning to you.

192
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,000
Ehlen wesehlen sibe te ji bi xêr.
 
Welcome, good morning to you too.

193
