We were passing by, we said let's stop at your place and ask
so we can all learn together how you make the ladders.

199
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Dest pêkê, çend sal ne ev karî silima di kî û êş kî elimî?
 
First, how many years have you been doing this ladder work
