We also learned from our older brother. My older brother
traded poplar wood.

201
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Û ji wî wextî da me bale şikr, em pê re hatin. Birayê min ê
mezin,
 
And since that time we paid attention, we came with him. My
older brother,

202
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Qaweq dikirîn û difirotin. Qaweq dikirîn, dişandin Qamîşlo,
