He bought and sold poplar wood. He bought poplar, sent it to
Qamishlo, sent it to Amude, sent it to Aleppo.

203
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Hemû cîya.
 
Everywhere.

204
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,000
Mîna tîcareta darên qaweqê anîn.
 
Like a trade of bringing poplar trees.

205
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Hemû cîyekî deçûn. Dişandin Minbicê. Ewe çi qaweq dikirîn,
dişandin wan dera.
 
They went everywhere. They sent it to Minbic. Whatever
poplar they bought, they sent it to those places.

206
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:18,000
Paşê, me dest bi silima kir.
 
Then, we started making ladders.

207
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:22,000
Esela bidayet kahraba di deştê nebî, b' dest a qul dikirin.
 
Basically in the beginning there was no electricity in the
plain, they made holes by hand.

208
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,000
M' dest a ... qul dikirin.. baş çareser bî.
 
They made holes by hand... then it was solved.

209
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Paşê kehrebe hat, me qul dikirin, û pêve di xistin.
 
Then electricity came, we made holes, and put them together.

210
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Û dar tunin, naha dar ji Tirkîyê têne.
 
And there's no wood, now wood comes from Turkey.

211
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,000
Dar êş Tirkîyê têne..
 
Wood comes from Turkey..

212
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,000
Hemî ji Tirkîyê têne..
 
It all comes from Turkey..

213
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Em tînin, noka ji te re şerih kim ser menşer e,
 
We bring it, now let me explain to you on the saw,

214
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,000
E qut kîn û çê kîn,
 
We cut it and make it,

215
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,000
Û ji wan menşera em de havalînin ji çê kirinê.
 
And from those saws we pass them on for assembly.

216
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Ê Tirkîyê ne?
 
Are they from Turkey?

217
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,000
Naha ev a ji Tirkîyê ne. Em tînin.
 
Now these are from Turkey. We bring them.

218
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Çiqas e çê dikin ser menşer e,
 
Whatever we make is on the saw,

219
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,000
Qut dikîn, çê dikîn,
 
We cut it, we make it,

220
00:16:48,000 --> 00:17:08,000
Û ji vê menşer ê, em dehavelînin ciyê çê kirin ê.
 
And from this saw, we send it to the assembly place.

221
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,000
Şablon çêkiriye em kê binerin.
 
You made a template, let's look.

222
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:18,000
Vê cûn e dîrok e... j' qaweqa dikirin silim u j' her dera
dafirotin ji.
 
This is an old history... they made ladders from poplar and
sold them everywhere too.

223
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Piştî wê, naha ji Tirkîyê tê.
 
After that, now it comes from Turkey.

224
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:27,000
Darbas da'bê ser mîkanê bî.. Piştî we derbas da'be, destê a
di rakvin in.
 
It passes on the machine.. After it passes, they assemble it
by hand.

225
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Hêwe dest e dî rekbînin.
 
Like this they assemble it by hand.

226
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:36,000
Vê silima ji minetiqê me gav bir der a divin, û li didin û
dîfiroşin ji.
 
They take this ladder to many places in our region, and they
give and sell them too.

227
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:41,000
Em li zeytûna da tê çê dikin cewaz dîkin am let di bi da
keran man a zeytûna.
 
We make them ready for the olives, we prepare them so people
can use them for the olives.

228
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,000
Ê zeytûna deçî ne.
 
These go to the olives.

229
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:47,000
Bêlî, xale min ew xeta te qewex tê ji te kete...
 
Yes my uncle, this path, do you bring poplar trees...

230
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Text e qaweqê ji tirkê tên. Qaweq îştirkê tên.
 
Poplar boards come from Turkey. Poplar comes from Turkey.

231
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:55,000
Berî we de, li kêtix min deçîn.. noka t'nîne me ov ber da
der keve...
 
Before that, we planted them in Kitix.. now there isn't any,
we let that water go out...

232
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:12,000
Noka t'nîn. Qewax t'nîn. Am ş'Tirkîye tînin.
 
Now there isn't any. There is no poplar. We bring from
Turkey.

233
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:15,000
Diçon di û piştê we re diki di di kîn silim
 
They planted and after that they made them into ladders

234
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:19,000
Badî şeş sala xidmet ek di kî baçê di kîn silim.
 
After six years of service, after that they make ladders.

235
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Te çî nin... şitla şit e.. cî di kin e..
 
You plant... the seedlings... they prepare them..

236
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,000
Da r' qawe q e, şe ke ne di çî nin...
 
Poplar trees, they break and plant...

237
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,000
Şeş sal a xizmete di ki.. piş we de kîn silim.
 
They do six years of service.. after that they make ladders.

238
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:33,000
Belê. Nu ka te kînî ji me ra xeber dî ji min bi haş min...
